# Forms Validation

- One schema ({{zod}}) per form in `lib/validation/`, used on client **and** server.
- Visible labels (placeholder is not a label), `autocomplete` attributes, required marked in text.
- Errors: field-level text linked with `aria-describedby`, summary at the top on submit, focus moves to the first error; keep what the user typed.
- No redundant entry (WCAG 3.3.7); paste allowed everywhere; no CAPTCHA puzzles without an alternative.

## Never
- Validate only on the client
- clear the form on error
- disable submit without saying why
